msgid "Prerequisites Checker"
msgstr "必要套件檢查工具"

msgid "Prerequisites Checker Gramplet"
msgstr "必要條件檢查器 Gramplet"

msgid ""
"Diagnostic Gramplet to help evaluate if <a href=\"https://gramps-project.org/"
"\">Gramps</a> has all <a href=\"https://github.com/gramps-project/gramps/"
"blob/master/README.md\">prerequisites</a> installed.\n"
msgstr ""
"用來協助檢查 <a href=\"https://gramps-project.org/\">Gramps</a> 是否已安裝所"
"有 <a href=\"https://github.com/gramps-project/gramps/blob/master/"
"README.md\">必要條件</a> 的診斷 Gramplet。\n"

msgid ""
"Diagnostic Gramplet to help evaluate if Gramps has all prerequisites "
"installed."
msgstr "協助評估 Gramps 是否已安裝所有必要套件的診斷 Gramplet。"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>REQUIRED</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>必要</b></u>\n"

msgid ""
"<i>Installations of the following packages are <b>ABSOLUTELY REQUIRED</b>\n"
" (Requires the minimum version or greater.)</i>:\n"
msgstr ""
"<i><b>必須安裝</b>下列套件\n"
"（需要最低版本或更新版本。）</i>：\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>RECOMMENDED</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>建議</b></u>\n"

msgid ""
"<i>Installations of the following packages are <b>STRONGLY RECOMMENDED</b> "
"as necessary for Geography and Charts</i>:\n"
msgstr "<i><b>強烈建議</b>安裝以下套件，地理與圖表功能需要這些套件</i>：\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>Optional</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>選用</b></u>\n"

msgid "<i>Installations of the following packages are <b>optional</b></i>:\n"
msgstr "<i>以下套件的安裝為 <b>選用</b></i>：\n"

msgid "Gtkspell enables spell checking in the notes.\n"
msgstr "Gtkspell 可啟用備註的拼字檢查。\n"

msgid ""
"Python Image Library (PIL) is needed for cropping images and LaTeX output."
msgstr "裁切圖片及 LaTeX 輸出需要 Python Image Library (PIL)。"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>Development & Translation Requirements</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>開發與翻譯需求</b></u>\n"

msgid ""
"<i>Installations of the following packages are <b>RECOMMENDED</b> if you "
"intend to translate or do any development (addons etc.)</i>:\n"
msgstr ""
"<i>若您打算翻譯或進行任何開發 (附加元件等)，<b>建議</b>安裝以下套件</i>：\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>Optional packages required by Third-party Addons</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>第三方附加元件所需的選用套件</b></u>\n"

msgid ""
"<i>Prerequistes required for the following <a href=\"https://gramps-"
"project.org/wiki/index.php?title=Third-party_Addons\">Third-party Addons</a> "
"to work</i>:\n"
msgstr ""
"<i>以下<a href=\"https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php?title=Third-"
"party_Addons\">第三方附加元件</a>運作所需的必要套件</i>：\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>Diagnostic checks</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>診斷檢查</b></u>\n"

msgid "Check for potential issues.\n"
msgstr "檢查潛在問題。\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"Environment settings:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"環境設定：\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"<u><b>Locales available:</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"<u><b>可用的語系：</b></u>\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"<u><b>Back Up Your Genealogy Files.</b></u>\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<u><b>備份您的家譜檔案。</b></u>\n"

msgid ""
"If you have a reason to be checking Prerequisites, it is the right time to "
"back up your genealogy files, and then test your backups!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"如果您正在檢查必要條件，現在正是備份家譜檔案，並測試備份是否可用的好時機！\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"<i><a href=\"https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php?"
"title=How_to_make_a_backup\">Backup to Gramps XML</a> You will find \"Make "
"Backup...\" in the Family Tree menu of recent Gramps versions, otherwise use "
"\"Export...\" in the same menu but uncheck privacy options in the Exporter "
"Assistant in order to export all data.</i>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<i><a href=\"https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php?"
"title=How_to_make_a_backup\">備份為 Gramps XML</a> 在近期版本的 Gramps 中，您"
"可以在「家族樹」選單找到「製作備份...」；若沒有此選項，請使用同一選單中的「匯"
"出...」，並取消勾選匯出助理中的隱私選項，以匯出所有資料。</i>\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
" • Backups can be made at any time and, at a minimum, on the first day of "
"every month. But preferrably more often.\n"
msgstr " • 隨時都可以備份，至少應在每月第一天備份一次。但最好更頻繁地備份。\n"

msgid ""
" • It is strongly recommended to backup each of your Family Trees before any "
"upgrade.\n"
msgstr " • 強烈建議在任何升級之前，備份每一棵家族樹。\n"

msgid ""
" • Test your backups by creating a new Family Tree and then importing the "
"backup."
msgstr " • 建立新的家族樹並匯入備份，以測試備份。"

msgid ", is the most current version.\n"
msgstr "，為最新版本。\n"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have Gramps %s. Please make a backup and then upgrade.\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"您目前的 Gramps 版本為 %s。請先進行備份後再升級。\n"
"%s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have Gramps %s installed; an unreleased development version. Thank you "
"for contributing and testing; please report any issues. Backups are your "
"friend.\n"
msgstr ""
"您已安裝 Gramps %s，這是尚未發布的開發版本。感謝您的貢獻與測試；如有問題，請"
"回報。請善用備份。\n"

